WEBVTT

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:01.256
to producing, or bringing back,
an extinct species.

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:02.496
And this is news.

00:05:02.520 --> 00:05:04.976
We haven't announced this publicly before.

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:06.216
We're excited.

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:07.856
We've got to get past this point.

00:05:07.880 --> 00:05:10.404
We now want this ball of cells
to start to gastrulate,

00:05:10.428 --> 00:05:13.056
to turn in so that it will produce
the other tissues.

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:16.776
It'll go on and produce
a tadpole and then a frog.

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:18.016
Watch this space.

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:20.233
I think we're going to have
this frog hopping

00:05:20.257 --> 00:05:21.976
glad to be back in the world again.

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:24.536
(Applause)

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:25.766
Thank you.

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:27.896
(Applause)

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:30.578
We haven't done it yet,
but keep the applause ready.